{
  "$schema": "../../kit.schema.json",
  "name": "landing-next",
  "version": "1.2.0",
  "title": "Landing page con Next.js",
  "description": "Next.js + Tailwind con skills de diseño, buenas prácticas de React y despliegue en Vercel. Para landings que no parezcan hechas por IA.",
  "category": "landing",
  "tags": [
    "nextjs",
    "tailwind",
    "design",
    "vercel"
  ],
  "author": "kits",
  "base": {
    "command": "npx create-next-app@latest {{name}} --ts --tailwind --eslint --app --src-dir --import-alias \"@/*\" --use-{{pm}} --disable-git --no-agent-feedback --yes"
  },
  "verify": {
    "command": "{{pm}} run build",
    "matrix": [
      {
        "component-addons": [
          "kokonutui",
          "magicui"
        ],
        "animation": [
          "motion",
          "gsap"
        ],
        "observability": [
          "sentry-nextjs",
          "posthog-nextjs"
        ]
      },
      {
        "i18n": [
          "next-intl"
        ],
        "testing": [
          "vitest"
        ],
        "quality": [
          "husky-lint-staged"
        ],
        "ci": [
          "github-actions"
        ],
        "deploy": [
          "vercel"
        ],
        "animation": [
          "motion"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "skills": [
    "anthropics/skills@frontend-design",
    "vercel-labs/agent-skills@web-design-guidelines",
    "vercel-labs/agent-skills@vercel-react-best-practices",
    "vercel-labs/agent-skills@deploy-to-vercel"
  ],
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "extras",
      "label": "Extras",
      "type": "multi",
      "default": [],
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "seo",
          "label": "SEO y Open Graph",
          "instructions": "## SEO\n\nCada página exporta `metadata` (título, descripción, Open Graph). Genera `src/app/sitemap.ts`, `src/app/robots.ts` y una imagen OG con `opengraph-image.tsx`."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "libraries": {
    "framework": [
      "react",
      "nextjs"
    ],
    "components": "shadcn",
    "addons": [],
    "animation": [
      "motion"
    ],
    "observability": [
      "vercel-analytics"
    ],
    "i18n": "none",
    "testing": [],
    "quality": [],
    "ci": [],
    "deploy": "vercel",
    "workflow": [
      "superpowers",
      "mattpocock-skills"
    ]
  },
  "instructions": "## Cómo trabajar aquí\n\n- Secciones de la landing como componentes en `src/components/sections/`.\n- Antes de escribir UI, lee el skill `frontend-design` y define dirección visual (tipografía, color, ritmo).\n- Revisa el resultado con `web-design-guidelines` antes de dar algo por terminado.",
  "language": "typescript"
}
